     "<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Hello friends, colleagues, and fellow statistical ecologists,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Apologies for cross posting, but I am hoping you can help me spread the word about this fully funded PhD I am advertising. The details are attached and a blurb below.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">‘<span style=\"color:black\">Developing efficient and accessible “data-to-decision” pipelines for remotely sensed biodiversity data.’<u></u><u></u></span></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">Home institution</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">: <i>University of St Andrews</i><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">Supervisors</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">: <u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:72.0pt\"><u></u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:106%;color:black\"><span>-<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">          </span></span></span><u></u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:106%;color:black\">Chris Sutherland (Univ. of St Andrews, Center for Research into Ecological &amp; Environmental Modelling)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:72.0pt\"><u></u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:106%;color:black\"><span>-<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">          </span></span></span><u></u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:106%;color:black\">Xavier Lambin (Univ. of Aberdeen, School of Biological Sciences)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:72.0pt\"><u></u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:106%;color:black\"><span>-<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">          </span></span></span><u></u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:106%;color:black\">Carl Chalmers (Liverpool John Moores University, Conservation AI)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:72.0pt\"><u></u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:106%;color:black\"><span>-<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">          </span></span></span><u></u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:106%;color:black\">Kenny Kortland (Forestry and Land Scotland)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">PhD start date</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">: 30th September 2024<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">Application deadline</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">: 9<sup>th</sup> February 2024<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">Application information</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">: <a href=\"https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/mathematics-statistics/prospective/pgr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/mathematics-statistics/prospective/pgr/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492964780000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3KMnci1B-_uT1XTRJLvqeu\">https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/mathematics-statistics/prospective/pgr/</a> <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">Apply</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">: <a href=\"https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/pgr/home.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/pgr/home.htm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492964780000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qqaqoceuFr_7ixx12Bo4o\">https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/pgr/home.htm</a> <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">Contact</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">: Chris Sutherland </span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">cs...@st-andrews.ac.uk</span></a><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Many thanks, and happy new year to all<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Chris<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
